ilding rental; ready-mix concrete and aggregates quarry production; and mining, trading, transportation, and construction activities. In addition, it engages in the information system, investment, freight forwarding, stevedoring, sea transportation service, logistic management, and outsourcing businesses, as well as procures public goods and services. PT Semen Indonesia (Persero) Tbk was formerly known as PT Semen Gresik (Persero) Tbk and changed its name to PT Semen Indonesia (Persero) Tbk in January 2013. The company was founded in 1953 and is headquartered in Jakarta Selatan, Indonesia. PT Semen Indonesia (Persero) Tbk operates as a subsidiary of PT Danantara Asset Management (Persero).","fullTimeEmployees":8496,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Indrieffouny  Indra","age":58,"title":"President Director","yearBorn":1967,"exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Sigit  Prastowo","age":54,"title":"Finance & Risk Management Director and Director","yearBorn":1971,"exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Reni  Wulandari","age":51,"title":"Director of Operations & Director","yearBorn":1974,"exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Febriandita  Kusuma","title":"Senior Vice President of Strategic Finance & Investor Relation","exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Antonius Ardian Bermana","title":"Chief of Risk, Strategy & Sustainability and SVP of Governance, Risk & Compliance","exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"},"unexercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0"}},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Maralda Hernanda Kairupan","title":"Senior Vice President of Legal","exercisedValue":{"raw":0,"fmt":null,"longFmt":"0